description:
Follow or unfollow a Nekoweb site from your account. Checks first, so following a site you already follow (or unfollowing one you don't) changes nothing.

Requires the optional session token (NEKOWEB_SESSION_TOKEN). If it isn't set, this tool returns setup steps to pass on to the user.

Examples:
  - "Follow fairfruit.nekoweb.org" -> { site: "fairfruit.nekoweb.org" }
  - "Unfollow eyeorb.net" -> { site: "eyeorb.net", follow: false }
